# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com — enter the inbox that should receive
# submissions and they email you the key. Copy this file to `.env` and paste it in.
#
# This value ships in the client bundle by design; Web3Forms keys are public and
# only allow sending to the address they were registered with.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Supabase project for the parents' platform (login, profiles, enrollments).
# Both values come from the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings → API Keys.
# The publishable key (sb_publishable_...) is safe to ship in the browser; Row
# Level Security in supabase/schema.sql is what keeps each family's data private.
# Never put a secret key (sb_secret_... / service_role) here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
